  "Answer 10 questions to start": ["Beantwoord 10 vrae om te begin", "Araba dipotšišo tše 10 go thoma", "Hlamula swivutiso swa 10 ku sungula", "Phendula imibuzo eyi-10 ukuze uqale"],
