  "Ask us to delete your account and personal information? An administrator completes the request. Records the law requires us to keep (such as completed sales for tax) are kept without your personal details.": ["Vra ons om jou rekening en persoonlike inligting te skrap? 'n Administrateur voltooi die versoek. Rekords wat die wet vereis dat ons hou (soos voltooide verkope vir belasting) word sonder jou persoonlike besonderhede gehou.", "Re kgopela go phumola akhaonte ya gago le tshedimošo ya gago? Molaodi o phethagatša kgopelo. Direkhoto tše molao o re nyakago gore re di boloke (go swana le dithekišo tše di phethilwego tša motšhelo) di bolokwa ntle le dintlha tša gago.", "Hi kombela ku sula akhawunti ya wena na vuxokoxoko bya wena? Mulawuri u hetisisa xikombelo. Tirekhodo leti nawu wu lavaka leswaku hi ti hlayisa (ku fana na swixavisiwa leswi heleke swa xibalo) ti hlayisiwa handle ka vuxokoxoko bya wena.", "Usicela ukuthi sisuse i-akhawunti yakho nolwazi lwakho? Umphathi uqedela isicelo. Amarekhodi umthetho ofuna sigcine wona (njengokuthengisa okuqediwe kwentela) agcinwa ngaphandle kwemininingwane yakho."],
