  "Best: the CSV export from your bank's app. Also works: the bank's PDF statement, a scanned statement or a clear photo.": ["Beste: die CSV-uitvoer uit jou bank se app. Werk ook: die bank se PDF-staat, 'n geskandeerde staat of 'n duidelike foto.", "Ye kaone: CSV go tšwa go app ya panka ya gago. Le tšona di a šoma: setatemente sa PDF sa panka, setatemente se se skeniwego goba seswantšho se se bonagalago gabotse.", "Swa kahle: CSV ku suka eka app ya banka ya wena. Na swona swa tirha: xitatimende xa PDF xa banka, xitatimende lexi skeniweke kumbe xifaniso lexi vonakaka kahle.", "Okungcono: i-CSV evela ku-app yebhange lakho. Kuyasebenza futhi: isitatimende se-PDF sebhange, isitatimende esiskeniwe noma isithombe esicacile."],
