  "Booking, container and transport, often also customs clearing.": ["Bespreking, houer en vervoer, dikwels ook doeaneklaring.", "Peeletšo, setshelo le dinamelwa, gantši le go phatlalatša ga motlakase wa ditšhupetšo (customs).", "Ku buka, khonteyina na swifambo, nkarhi wo tala na ku basisa eka ntsengo (customs).", "Ukubhuka, isiqukathi nezokuthutha, kaningi nokukhishwa emakhastomu."],
