  "Both parties are notified. While the dispute is open, contact details stay visible so you can try to settle it directly.": ["Albei partye word in kennis gestel. Terwyl die geskil oop is, bly kontakbesonderhede sigbaar sodat julle dit direk kan probeer skik.", "Mahlakore ka bobedi a tsebišwa. Ge ngangišano e sa butšwe, dintlha tša kgokagano di dula di bonagala gore le leke go e rarolla thwii.", "Matlhelo hamambirhi ya tivisiwa. Loko mholovo wa ha ha pfuriwile, vuxokoxoko bya vuhlanganisi byi tshama byi vonaka leswaku mi ringeta ku wu lulamisa hi ku kongoma.", "Izinhlangothi zombili ziyaziswa. Ngesikhathi ingxabano isavuliwe, imininingwane yokuxhumana ihlala ibonakala ukuze nizame ukuyixazulula ngqo."],
