  "Buyer's favour cancels the order (stock is returned if it was never delivered). Farmer's favour and a split return the order to where it was.": ["'n Beslissing ten gunste van die koper kanselleer die bestelling (voorraad word teruggegee as dit nooit afgelewer is nie). 'n Beslissing ten gunste van die boer en 'n verdeling stel die bestelling terug na waar dit was.", "Sephetho seo se ratago moreki se khansela oda (thoto e a bušwa ge e sa ka ya išwa). Sephetho seo se ratago molemi le kabelano di bušetša oda moo e bego e le gona.", "Xiboho lexi tsakisaka muxavi xi khansela oda (nhundzu yi tlheriseriwa loko yi nga si yisiwa). Xiboho lexi tsakisaka murimi na ku avelana swi tlherisela oda laha a yi ri kona.", "Isinqumo esivuna umthengi sikhansela i-oda (isitoko siyabuyiselwa uma singakaze silethwe). Isinqumo esivuna umlimi nokwabelana kubuyisela i-oda lapho belikhona."],
