  "Deadlines appear here when your profile needs them (tax, UIF, CIPC) or when documents in your vault expire.": ["Sperdatums verskyn hier wanneer jou profiel dit benodig (belasting, UIF, CIPC) of wanneer dokumente in jou kluis verval.", "Matšatši a mafelelo a tšwelela mo ge profaele ya gago e a nyaka (motšhelo, UIF, CIPC) goba ge ditokumente polokelong ya gago di fela nako.", "Masiku yo hetelela ya humelela laha loko profayili ya wena yi ma lava (xibalo, UIF, CIPC) kumbe loko matsalwa eka vuhlayiselo bya wena ya hela nkarhi.", "Izinsuku zokugcina zivela lapha uma iphrofayela yakho izidinga (intela, i-UIF, i-CIPC) noma uma imibhalo yakho iphelelwa yisikhathi."],
