  "Enter the 6-digit delivery code the buyer gives you:": ["Voer die 6-syfer-afleweringskode in wat die koper aan jou gee:", "Tsenya khoutu ya go iša ya dinomoro tše 6 yeo moreki a go fago yona:", "Nghenisa khodi ya ku yisa ya tinomboro ta 6 leyi muxavi a ku nyikaka yona:", "Faka ikhodi yokulethwa yezinombolo eziyi-6 umthengi akunika yona:"],
  "Enter your mobile number or email and we will send you a reset link.": ["Voer jou selnommer of e-pos in en ons stuur vir jou 'n herstelskakel.", "Tsenya nomoro ya gago ya selefoune goba imeile gomme re tla go romela kgokagano ya go fetola.", "Nghenisa nomboro ya wena ya selfoni kumbe imeyili kutani hi ta ku rhumela xihlanganisi xo vuyisa.", "Faka inombolo yakho yeselula noma i-imeyili bese sikuthumelela isixhumanisi sokusetha kabusha."],
