  "Every certificate, in one safe place.": ["Elke sertifikaat, op een veilige plek.", "Setifikeiti se sengwe le se sengwe, lefelong le tee le le bolokegilego.", "Xitifikheti xin'wana na xin'wana, endhawini yin'we leyi hlayisekeke.", "Zonke izitifiketi, endaweni eyodwa ephephile."],
  "Every requirement shows the authority it comes from - PPECB, the Department of Agriculture, SARS Customs, the destination country or your buyer - so you know whom to call when a step is blocked.": ["Elke vereiste wys die owerheid waarvandaan dit kom - PPECB, die Departement van Landbou, SARS Doeane, die bestemmingsland of jou koper - sodat jy weet wie om te bel wanneer 'n stap vashaak.", "Nyakego ye nngwe le ye nngwe e bontšha bolaodi bjo e tšwago go bjona - PPECB, Kgoro ya Temo, SARS Customs, naga yeo go yago go yona goba moreki wa gago - gore o tsebe gore o leletša mang ge kgato e thibilwe.", "Xilaveko xin'wana na xin'wana xi komba vulawuri lebyi xi humaka eka byona - PPECB, Ndzawulo ya Vurimi, SARS Customs, tiko leri swi yaka eka rona kumbe muxavi wa wena - leswaku u tiva loyi u n'wi fonelaka loko goza ri sivikiwile.", "Isidingo ngasinye sikhombisa isiphathimandla esivela kuso - i-PPECB, uMnyango wezoLimo, i-SARS Customs, izwe okuyiwa kulo noma umthengi wakho - ukuze wazi ukuthi ushayela bani uma isinyathelo sivinjiwe."],
  "Everything we hold about you, in one file (JSON).": ["Alles wat ons oor jou hou, in een lêer (JSON).", "Tšohle tše re nago le tšona ka ga gago, ka faeleng e tee (JSON).", "Hinkwaswo leswi hi nga na swona hi wena, eka fayili yin'we (JSON).", "Konke esinakho ngawe, efayeleni elilodwa (JSON)."],
