  "Export plan created. Stage 1 was checked against your Business Builder profile.": ["Uitvoerplan geskep. Stadium 1 is teen jou Besigheidsbouer-profiel nagegaan.", "Leano la go romela ntle le dirilwe. Kgato ya 1 e lekotšwe go ya ka profaele ya gago ya Mohlami wa Kgwebo.", "Pulani yo xavisa ehandle yi endliwile. Xiyenge xa 1 xi kamberiwile hi ku ya hi profayili ya wena ya Muakhi wa Bindzu.", "Uhlelo lokuthekelisa lwenziwe. Isigaba 1 sihlolwe ngokuqhathanisa nephrofayela yakho yoMakhi weBhizinisi."],
