  "Extracting lines, checking the balance and sorting each transaction into a category.": ["Haal lyne uit, gaan die balans na en sorteer elke transaksie in 'n kategorie.", "Re ntšha methaladi, re lekola tekano gomme re hlopha tirišano ye nngwe le ye nngwe ka legorong.", "Hi humesa milayeni, hi kambela balansi kutani hi hlela xiendlakalo xin'wana na xin'wana eka ntlawa.", "Sikhipha imigqa, sihlola ibhalansi futhi sihlela okwenziwe ngakunye esigabeni."],
