  "Find produce under Browse and press Order. You pay in cash on delivery.": ["Vind produkte onder Blaai en druk Bestel. Jy betaal kontant by aflewering.", "Hwetša dijo tša polasa ka fase ga Lebelela gomme o kgotle Oda. O lefa ka kheše ge di fihla.", "Kuma swibyariwa ehansi ka Languta kutani u tsindzela Oda. U hakela hi khexe loko swi fika.", "Thola umkhiqizo ngaphansi kokuthi Phequlula bese ucindezela u-Oda. Ukhokha ngokheshi uma kulethwa."],
  "Flagged ({n})": ["Gemerk ({n})", "Tše di swailwego ({n})", "Leswi fungiweke ({n})", "Okumakiwe ({n})"],
  "Fog": ["Mis", "Kgodi", "Nkungu", "Inkungu"],
  "Follows the light or dark setting on your phone or computer.": ["Volg die lig- of donker-instelling op jou foon of rekenaar.", "E latela peakanyo ya seetša goba ya leswiswi go mogala goba khomphutha ya gago.", "Yi landzela xiyimiso xa ku vonakala kumbe xa munyama eka foni kumbe khompyuta ya wena.", "Ilandela isilungiselelo sokukhanya noma sobumnyama efonini noma kukhompyutha yakho."],
  "For example a water-use licence renewal, a GLOBALG.A.P. audit or a loan repayment.": ["Byvoorbeeld 'n hernuwing van 'n watergebruiklisensie, 'n GLOBALG.A.P.-oudit of 'n leningsterugbetaling.", "Mohlala, go mpshafatša laesense ya tšhomišo ya meetse, tlhahlobo ya GLOBALG.A.P. goba tefo ya kadimo.", "Xikombiso, ku pfuxeta layisense yo tirhisa mati, ku kambela ka GLOBALG.A.P. kumbe ku hakela xikweleti.", "Isibonelo, ukuvuselela ilayisensi yokusebenzisa amanzi, ukuhlolwa kwe-GLOBALG.A.P. noma ukukhokha imali ebolekiwe."],
  "FOR SUPPLIERS": ["VIR VERSKAFFERS", "BAKENG SA BAFEPI", "SWA VAPHAKERI", "OKWABAHLINZEKI"],
  "For {name}": ["Vir {name}", "Bakeng sa {name}", "Ya {name}", "Ka-{name}"],
  "Forecast: Open-Meteo": ["Voorspelling: Open-Meteo", "Kakanyo ya boso: Open-Meteo", "Vuprofeta bya maxelo: Open-Meteo", "Isibikezelo: Open-Meteo"],
  "Fresh Produce Exporters' Forum": ["Fresh Produce Exporters' Forum", "Fresh Produce Exporters' Forum", "Fresh Produce Exporters' Forum", "Fresh Produce Exporters' Forum"],
  "From \"interested\" to \"shipment cleared\".": ["Van \"belangstellend\" tot \"besending geklaar\".", "Go tloga go \"ke a kgahlega\" go fihla go \"thoto e phatlaladitšwe\".", "Ku suka eka \"ndza tsakela\" ku fika eka \"nhundzu yi basisiwile\".", "Kusuka ku-\"nginentshisekelo\" kuya ku-\"impahla ikhishiwe\"."],
  "From farm to formal business.": ["Van plaas tot formele besigheid.", "Go tloga polaseng go ya kgwebong ya semmušo.", "Ku suka epurasini ku ya eka bindzu ra ximfumo.", "Kusuka epulazini kuya ebhizinisini elisemthethweni."],
  "From statements": ["Uit state", "Go tšwa dipegong", "Ku suka eka swiviko", "Kusuka ezitatimendeni"],
  "from your document vault": ["uit jou dokumentkluis", "go tšwa polokelong ya gago ya ditokumente", "ku suka eka vuhlayiselo bya wena bya matsalwa", "kusuka endaweni yakho ephephile yemibhalo"],
  "From {name}": ["Van {name}", "Go tšwa go {name}", "Ku suka eka {name}", "Kusuka ku-{name}"],
  "Frost risk this week: protect seedlings and young crops at night.": ["Rypgevaar hierdie week: beskerm saailinge en jong gewasse snags.", "Kotsi ya serame beke ye: šireletša dimela tše nnyane le dibjalo tše di sa golego bošego.", "Khombo ra xirhami vhiki leri: sirhelela swimilana na swimila leswitsongo nivusiku.", "Ingozi yesithwathwa kuleli sonto: vikela izithombo nezitshalo ezincane ebusuku."],
  "Fuel": ["Brandstof", "Makhura", "Mafurha", "Uphethiloli"],
  "Full name or business name": ["Volle naam of besigheidsnaam", "Leina ka botlalo goba leina la kgwebo", "Vito hi ku helela kumbe vito ra bindzu", "Igama eliphelele noma igama lebhizinisi"],
  "Generated from records entered and uploaded by the farmer. Guidance only - not tax, legal or financial advice.": ["Gegenereer uit rekords wat deur die boer ingevoer en opgelaai is. Slegs riglyne - nie belasting-, regs- of finansiële advies nie.", "E dirilwe go tšwa direkhotong tše di tsentšwego le go romelwa ke molemi. Ke tlhahlo fela - ga se keletšo ya motšhelo, ya molao goba ya ditšhelete.", "Swi endliwe ku suka eka tirekhodo leti nghenisiweke na ku rhumeriwa hi murimi. I nkongomiso ntsena - a hi switsundzuxo swa xibalo, swa nawu kumbe swa timali.", "Kwenziwe kusuka emarekhodini afakwe futhi alayishwe ngumlimi. Kungumhlahlandlela kuphela - akusona iseluleko sentela, somthetho noma sezimali."],
  "Generated {when} by AgriTech": ["Gegenereer {when} deur AgriTech", "E dirilwe {when} ke AgriTech", "Swi endliwe {when} hi AgriTech", "Kwenziwe {when} yi-AgriTech"],
  "GET STARTED": ["BEGIN", "THOMA", "SUNGULA", "QALA"],
  "Give this code to the farmer only when the produce reaches you.": ["Gee hierdie kode net aan die boer wanneer die produkte jou bereik.", "Efa molemi khoutu ye fela ge dijo di go fihlela.", "Nyika murimi khodi leyi ntsena loko swibyariwa swi ku fikela.", "Nikeza umlimi le khodi kuphela uma umkhiqizo ufika kuwe."],
  "GLOBALG.A.P., social audits and retailer standards - not law, but needed to sell.": ["GLOBALG.A.P., sosiale oudits en kleinhandelaarstandaarde - nie wet nie, maar nodig om te verkoop.", "GLOBALG.A.P., ditlhahlobo tša leago le maemo a barekiši - ga se molao, eupša di a nyakega go rekiša.", "GLOBALG.A.P., ku kambela ka vanhu na swiyimo swa vaxavisi - a hi nawu, kambe swa laveka ku xavisa.", "I-GLOBALG.A.P., ukuhlolwa kwezenhlalo namazinga abathengisi - akuwona umthetho, kodwa kuyadingeka ukuze uthengise."],
  "Go to my orders": ["Gaan na my bestellings", "Eya go diodara tša ka", "Ya eka tioda ta mina", "Iya kuma-oda ami"],
  "Good news: none of your orders are in dispute. If something goes wrong, open the order in Farm Market and choose “Report a problem”.": ["Goeie nuus: geen van jou bestellings is in geskil nie. As iets skeefloop, maak die bestelling in Plaasmark oop en kies \"Rapporteer 'n probleem\".", "Ditaba tše dibotse: ga go oda ya gago yeo e lego ngangišanong. Ge go na le seo se sa sepelego gabotse, bula oda go Mmaraka wa Polasa o kgethe “Bega bothata”.", "Mahungu lamanene: a ku na oda ya wena leyi nga emholovweni. Loko ku ri na leswi nga fambiki kahle, pfula oda eka Makete wa Purasi u hlawula “Vika xiphiqo”.", "Izindaba ezinhle: alikho i-oda lakho elisengxabanweni. Uma kukhona okungahambi kahle, vula i-oda eMakethe yePulazi bese ukhetha “Bika inkinga”."],
  "Grade": ["Graad", "Kreiti", "Xiyimo", "Ibanga"],
  "Grain": ["Graan", "Mabele", "Mavele", "Okusanhlamvu"],
  "grape": ["druif", "morara", "madiriva", "amagilebhisi"],
  "Green peppers": ["Groen soetrissies", "Dipepere tše tala", "Tipepere to rihlaza", "Upelepele oluhlaza"],
  "Group order": ["Groepbestelling", "Oda ya sehlopha", "Oda ya ntlawa", "I-oda leqembu"],
  "Group order closed.": ["Groepbestelling gesluit.", "Oda ya sehlopha e tswaletšwe.", "Oda ya ntlawa yi pfariwile.", "I-oda leqembu livaliwe."],
  "Group order published. Other farmers can join now.": ["Groepbestelling gepubliseer. Ander boere kan nou aansluit.", "Oda ya sehlopha e phatlaladitšwe. Balemi ba bangwe ba ka tsenela bjale.", "Oda ya ntlawa yi kandziyisiwile. Varimi van'wana va nga nghena sweswi.", "I-oda leqembu lishicilelwe. Abanye abalimi bangajoyina manje."],
  "GROUP ORDERS": ["GROEPBESTELLINGS", "DIODARA TŠA SEHLOPHA", "TIODA TA NTLAWA", "AMA-ODA EQEMBU"],
  "Group orders": ["Groepbestellings", "Diodara tša sehlopha", "Tioda ta ntlawa", "Ama-oda eqembu"],
  "Group-buying opportunities": ["Groepaankoopgeleenthede", "Dibaka tša go reka bjalo ka sehlopha", "Minkarhi ya ku xava tanihi ntlawa", "Amathuba okuthenga njengeqembu"],
  "Group-order activity": ["Groepbestellingaktiwiteit", "Ditiro tša diodara tša sehlopha", "Mintirho ya tioda ta ntlawa", "Umsebenzi wama-oda eqembu"],
  "Group-order alerts": ["Groepbestellingwaarskuwings", "Ditemošo tša diodara tša sehlopha", "Switsundzuxo swa tioda ta ntlawa", "Izexwayiso zama-oda eqembu"],
