  "Has worked through an export-readiness plan": ["Het deur 'n uitvoergereedheidsplan gewerk", "O šomile ka leano la go itokišetša go romela ntle", "U tirhile hi pulani yo tilulamisela ku xavisa ehandle", "Usebenze ngohlelo lokulungela ukuthekelisa"],
  "head": ["kop", "hlogo", "nhloko", "ikhanda"],
