  "Keep the entries it added to My Finances?\nOK = keep them, Cancel = remove them too.": ["Hou die inskrywings wat dit by My finansies gevoeg het?\nOK = hou hulle, Kanselleer = verwyder hulle ook.", "Boloka dingwalo tšeo e di okeditšego go Ditšhelete tša ka?\nOK = di boloke, Khansela = di tloše le tšona.", "Hlayisa leswi swi engeteriweke eka Timali ta mina?\nOK = swi hlayise, Khansela = swi susa na swona.", "Gcina okufakiwe okwengezwe ku-Izimali zami?\nOK = kugcine, Khansela = kususe nakho."],
  "Keep the original file in my encrypted document vault. (If unticked, the file is discarded once it has been read.)": ["Hou die oorspronklike lêer in my geënkripteerde dokumentkluis. (As dit nie gemerk is nie, word die lêer weggegooi sodra dit gelees is.)", "Boloka faele ya mathomo polokelong ya ka ya ditokumente ye e notletšwego. (Ge e sa swaiwa, faele e lahlwa ge e šetše e badilwe.)", "Hlayisa fayili yo sungula eka vuhlayiselo bya mina bya matsalwa lebyi khiyiweke. (Loko yi nga fungiwanga, fayili yi lahliwa loko yi hlayiwile.)", "Gcina ifayela langempela endaweni yami ephephile yemibhalo ebethelwe. (Uma kungamakiwe, ifayela liyalahlwa uma selifundiwe.)"],
  "kg": ["kg", "kg", "kg", "kg"],
  "Know where every rand goes.": ["Weet waarheen elke rand gaan.", "Tseba moo randa ye nngwe le ye nngwe e yago gona.", "Tiva laha randa yin'wana na yin'wana yi yaka kona.", "Yazi ukuthi irandi ngalinye liyaphi."],
  "Know where money is going and what your farm is earning. Farm Market sales are added automatically, and bank statements can be imported in Expense Analysis.": ["Weet waarheen geld gaan en wat jou plaas verdien. Plaasmark-verkope word outomaties bygevoeg, en bankstate kan in Uitgawe-ontleding ingevoer word.", "Tseba moo tšhelete e yago gona le seo polasa ya gago e se hwetšago. Dithekišo tša Mmaraka wa Polasa di okeletšwa ka bogona, gomme ditatemente tša panka di ka tsenywa go Tshekatsheko ya Ditshenyegelo.", "Tiva laha mali yi yaka kona na leswi purasi ra wena ri swi kumaka. Swixavisiwa swa Makete wa Purasi swi engeteriwa hi swoxe, naswona swiviko swa banka swi nga nghenisiwa eka Nxopaxopo wa Swihlawulo.", "Yazi ukuthi imali iyaphi nokuthi ipulazi lakho lizuzani. Ukuthengisa kweMakethe yePulazi kwengezwa ngokuzenzakalelayo, futhi izitatimende zasebhange zingafakwa ku-Ukuhlaziywa Kwezindleko."],
