  "List the suppliers and products you sell here. Farmers will see them in the Supplier Shop and can buy them together through Group Orders.": ["Lys die verskaffers en produkte wat jy hier verkoop. Boere sien dit in die Verskafferwinkel en kan dit saam deur Groepbestellings koop.", "Ngwala bafepi le ditšweletšwa tšeo o di rekišago mo. Balemi ba tla di bona go Lebenkele la Bafepi gomme ba ka di reka mmogo ka Diodara tša Sehlopha.", "Tsala vaphakeri na swibuweriwa leswi u swi xavisaka laha. Varimi va ta swi vona eka Xitolo xa Vaphakeri naswona va nga swi xava swin'we hi Tioda ta Ntlawa.", "Faka abahlinzeki nemikhiqizo oyithengisa lapha. Abalimi bazoyibona eSitolo Sabahlinzeki futhi bangayithenga ndawonye ngama-oda eqembu."],
  "List what you grow, or find fresh produce from farmers near you.": ["Lys wat jy kweek, of vind vars produkte van boere naby jou.", "Ngwala seo o se lemago, goba hwetša dijo tše foreše go balemi ba kgauswi le wena.", "Tsala leswi u swi rimaka, kumbe kuma swibyariwa leswintshwa eka varimi lava nga ekusuhi na wena.", "Faka okulimayo, noma uthole umkhiqizo omusha kubalimi abaseduze nawe."],
