  "Little rain expected: plan irrigation for the week.": ["Min reën verwag: beplan besproeiing vir die week.", "Pula ye nnyane e letetšwe: rulaganya go nošetša ga beke.", "Mpfula yitsongo yi languteriwile: pulana ku cheleta ka vhiki.", "Kulindeleke imvula encane: hlela ukunisela kwesonto."],
  "Live test environment: connection is not encrypted. Use synthetic data, not real farm locations or bank information.": ["Regstreekse toetsomgewing: die verbinding is nie geënkripteer nie. Gebruik sintetiese data, nie regte plaasliggings of bankinligting nie.", "Tikologo ya teko ye e phelago: kgokagano ga e a notlelwa. Šomiša data ya maitirelo, e sego mafelo a nnete a dipolasa goba tshedimošo ya panka.", "Ndhawu ya ku ringeta leyi hanyaka: vuhlanganisi a byi khiyiwanga. Tirhisa data yo endliwa, ku nga ri tindhawu ta xiviri ta mapurasi kumbe vuxokoxoko bya banka.", "Indawo yokuhlola ebukhoma: uxhumano alubethelwe. Sebenzisa idatha yokwenziwa, hhayi izindawo zangempela zamapulazi noma ulwazi lwasebhange."],
