  "Most banking apps and internet banking let you download transactions as CSV (sometimes called \"Excel\" or \"spreadsheet\") under the account's transaction history or statements. Choose the period you want, usually one month. PDF statements downloaded from the bank also work well because they contain real text.": ["Die meeste bankapps en internetbankdienste laat jou transaksies as CSV aflaai (soms \"Excel\" of \"sigblad\" genoem) onder die rekening se transaksiegeskiedenis of state. Kies die tydperk wat jy wil hê, gewoonlik een maand. PDF-state wat van die bank afgelaai is, werk ook goed omdat hulle regte teks bevat.", "Diapp tše dintši tša panka le panka ya inthanete di go dumelela go laolla ditirišano bjalo ka CSV (ka nako ye nngwe e bitšwa \"Excel\" goba \"spreadsheet\") ka fase ga histori ya ditirišano goba ditatemente tša akhaonte. Kgetha nako ye o e nyakago, gantši kgwedi e tee. Ditatemente tša PDF tše di laolotšwego pankeng le tšona di šoma gabotse ka gobane di na le mongwalo wa nnete.", "Ti-app to tala ta banka na banka ya inthanete ti ku pfumelela ku kopela swiendlakalo tanihi CSV (minkarhi yin'wana yi vuriwa \"Excel\" kumbe \"spreadsheet\") ehansi ka matimu ya swiendlakalo kumbe swiviko swa akhawunti. Hlawula nkarhi lowu u wu lavaka, hi ntolovelo n'hweti yin'we. Swiviko swa PDF leswi kopeleriweke ebankeni na swona swa tirha kahle hikuva swi na matsalwa ya xiviri.", "Ama-app amaningi asebhange nebhange le-inthanethi akuvumela ukulanda okwenziwe njenge-CSV (ngesinye isikhathi kubizwa ngokuthi \"Excel\" noma \"spreadsheet\") ngaphansi komlando wokwenziwe noma izitatimende ze-akhawunti. Khetha isikhathi osifunayo, ngokuvamile inyanga eyodwa. Izitatimende ze-PDF ezilandwe ebhange nazo zisebenza kahle ngoba ziqukethe umbhalo wangempela."],
