  "No pack specifications available for comparisons across listings.": ["Geen verpakkingspesifikasies beskikbaar vir vergelykings tussen lyste nie.", "Ga go na ditlhalošo tša dipakete tšeo di ka bapetšwago magareng ga dipapatšo.", "A ku na tinhlamuselo ta maphakeji leti nga pimanisiwaka exikarhi ka swinavetiso.", "Ayikho imininingwane yamaphakethe yokuqhathanisa phakathi kokufakiwe."],
  "No photos or documents yet. Photos of the produce, delivery notes or proof of payment help a lot.": ["Nog geen foto's of dokumente nie. Foto's van die produkte, afleweringsnotas of bewys van betaling help baie.", "Ga go na diswantšho goba ditokumente gabjale. Diswantšho tša dijo, mangwalo a go iša goba bohlatse bja tefo di thuša kudu.", "A ku si na swifaniso kumbe matsalwa. Swifaniso swa swibyariwa, swiviko swa ku yisa kumbe vumbhoni bya ku hakela swi pfuna ngopfu.", "Azikabikho izithombe noma imibhalo. Izithombe zomkhiqizo, amanothi okulethwa noma ubufakazi bokukhokha kusiza kakhulu."],
  "No pin yet. Without one, buyers searching by distance will not find this listing.": ["Nog geen speld nie. Sonder een sal kopers wat volgens afstand soek nie hierdie lys vind nie.", "Ga go na phini gabjale. Ntle le yona, bareki bao ba nyakago go ya ka sebaka ba ka se hwetše papatšo ye.", "A ku si na phini. Handle ka yona, vaxavi lava lavaka hi mpfhuka a va nge xi kumi xinavetiso lexi.", "Ayikabikho iphini. Ngaphandle kwayo, abathengi abasesha ngebanga ngeke bakuthole lokhu okufakiwe."],
