  "No recorded listings match these filters.": ["Geen aangetekende lyste pas by hierdie filters nie.", "Ga go na dipapatšo tše di ngwadilwego tše di swanago le disefa tše.", "A ku na swinavetiso leswi tsariweke leswi fambelanaka na swihluti leswi.", "Akukho okufakiwe okubhaliwe okuhambisana nalezi zihlungi."],
  "No recorded produce demand or verified market observations yet.": ["Nog geen aangetekende vraag na produkte of geverifieerde markwaarnemings nie.", "Ga go na tlhokego ya dijo ye e ngwadilwego goba ditebelelo tša mmaraka tše di netefaditšwego gabjale.", "A ku si na xilaveko xa swibyariwa lexi tsariweke kumbe ku languta ka makete loku tiyisisiweke.", "Akukabikho isidingo somkhiqizo esibhaliwe noma ukubhekwa kwemakethe okuqinisekisiwe."],
