  "No supplier has listed products yet. Suppliers can add theirs in the Supplier Portal.": ["Geen verskaffer het al produkte gelys nie. Verskaffers kan hulle s'n in die Verskafferportaal byvoeg.", "Ga go mofepi yo a ngwadilego ditšweletšwa gabjale. Bafepi ba ka oketša tša bona go Portale ya Mofepi.", "A ku si na muphakeri loyi a tsaleke swibuweriwa. Vaphakeri va nga engetela swa vona eka Photali ya Muphakeri.", "Akakabikho umhlinzeki ofake imikhiqizo. Abahlinzeki bangengeza eyabo ePhothali Yomhlinzeki."],
  "No supplier products yet": ["Nog geen verskafferprodukte nie", "Ga go na ditšweletšwa tša bafepi gabjale", "A ku si na swibuweriwa swa vaphakeri", "Ayikabikho imikhiqizo yabahlinzeki"],
