  "On your phone, open your authenticator app and add an account.": ["Maak jou verifikasie-app op jou foon oop en voeg 'n rekening by.", "Mogaleng wa gago, bula app ya gago ya netefatšo gomme o oketše akhaonte.", "Eka foni ya wena, pfula app ya wena ya ku tiyisisa u engetela akhawunti.", "Efonini yakho, vula i-app yakho yokuqinisekisa bese wengeza i-akhawunti."],
  "ONE PLATFORM · FIVE SERVICES · BUILT FOR SOUTH AFRICAN FARMERS": ["EEN PLATFORM · VYF DIENSTE · GEBOU VIR SUID-AFRIKAANSE BOERE", "SETHALA SE TEE · DITIRELO TŠE HLANO · SE AGETŠWE BALEMI BA AFRIKA BORWA", "XIYIMO XIN'WE · VUKORHOKERI BYA NTLHANU · XI AKERIWE VARIMI VA AFRIKA-DZONGA", "INKUNDLA EYODWA · IZINSIZA EZINHLANU · YAKHELWE ABALIMI BASENINGIZIMU AFRIKA"],
  "onion": ["ui", "eiye", "anyanisi", "u-anyanisi"],
  "Onions": ["Uie", "Dieiye", "Tinyanisi", "U-anyanisi"],
  "Only the steps that apply to your answers are shown. Mark a step \"does not apply\" if your situation is different.": ["Net die stappe wat op jou antwoorde van toepassing is, word gewys. Merk 'n stap \"nie van toepassing nie\" as jou situasie anders is.", "Ke magato fela a a amago dikarabo tša gago a a bontšhwago. Swaya kgato \"ga e amege\" ge boemo bja gago bo fapane.", "Ku kombisiwa ntsena magoza lama khumbaka tinhlamulo ta wena. Funga goza ri \"a swi khumbi\" loko xiyimo xa wena xi hambana.", "Kukhonjiswa kuphela izinyathelo ezithinta izimpendulo zakho. Maka isinyathelo \"akusebenzi\" uma isimo sakho sehlukile."],
  "Only you see this": ["Net jy sien dit", "Ke wena fela yo a bonago se", "Hi wena ntsena loyi u swi vonaka", "Nguwe kuphela obona lokhu"],
  "Only {qty} {unit} available. Please lower the quantity.": ["Slegs {qty} {unit} beskikbaar. Verlaag asseblief die hoeveelheid.", "Go na le {qty} {unit} fela. Hle fokotša bontši.", "Ku na {qty} {unit} ntsena. Hi kombela u hunguta nhlayo.", "Kukhona u-{qty} {unit} kuphela. Sicela wehlise inani."],
