  "Opening balance + all transactions should equal the closing balance": ["Openingsbalans + alle transaksies behoort gelyk te wees aan die sluitingsbalans", "Tekano ya mathomo + ditirišano ka moka di swanetše go lekana le tekano ya mafelelo", "Balansi yo sungula + swiendlakalo hinkwaswo swi fanele ku ringana na balansi yo hetelela", "Ibhalansi yokuqala + konke okwenziwe kufanele kulingane nebhalansi yokugcina"],
