  "Order #{id} (already in your income)": ["Bestelling #{id} (reeds in jou inkomste)", "Oda #{id} (e šetše e le letsenong la gago)", "Oda #{id} (se yi ri eka mali leyi nghenaka ya wena)", "I-oda #{id} (selisemalini yakho engenayo)"],
  "Order now": ["Bestel nou", "Oda bjale", "Oda sweswi", "Oda manje"],
  "Order sent. The farmer needs to accept it before anything is reserved.": ["Bestelling gestuur. Die boer moet dit aanvaar voordat enigiets gereserveer word.", "Oda e rometšwe. Molemi o swanetše go e amogela pele selo se bewa ka thoko.", "Oda yi rhumeriwile. Murimi u fanele ku yi amukela ku nga si hlayisiwa nchumu.", "I-oda lithunyelwe. Umlimi kufanele alamukele ngaphambi kokuba kubekwe noma yini eceleni."],
  "Order summary": ["Bestellingopsomming", "Kakaretšo ya oda", "Nkatsakanyo wa oda", "Isifinyezo se-oda"],
  "Order updated.": ["Bestelling bygewerk.", "Oda e mpshafaditšwe.", "Oda yi pfuxetiwile.", "I-oda libuyekeziwe."],
  "Order updates, disputes, compliance deadlines and export-rule changes. In-app notifications are always on.": ["Bestellingopdaterings, geskille, nakomingsperdatums en veranderinge aan uitvoerreëls. Kennisgewings in die app is altyd aan.", "Diphetogo tša diodara, dingangišano, matšatši a mafelelo a kobamelo le diphetogo tša melao ya go romela ntle. Ditsebišo ka app di dula di butšwe.", "Mahungu ya tioda, timholovo, masiku yo hetelela ya ku landzela milawu na ku cinca ka milawu yo xavisa ehandle. Switiviso eka app swi tshama swi pfuriwile.", "Izibuyekezo zama-oda, izingxabano, izinsuku zokugcina zokuthobela nezinguquko zemithetho yokuthekelisa. Izaziso ku-app zihlala zivuliwe."],
  "Order {product} from {seller}": ["Bestel {product} van {seller}", "Oda {product} go {seller}", "Oda {product} eka {seller}", "Oda {product} ku-{seller}"],
  "Orders": ["Bestellings", "Diodara", "Tioda", "Ama-oda"],
  "Orders for your produce": ["Bestellings vir jou produkte", "Diodara tša dijo tša gago", "Tioda ta swibyariwa swa wena", "Ama-oda omkhiqizo wakho"],
  "Orders you placed": ["Bestellings wat jy geplaas het", "Diodara tšeo o di dirilego", "Tioda leti u ti endleke", "Ama-oda owafakile"],
  "Orders, disputes, group orders, compliance deadlines and export-rule changes. New ones arrive instantly. Choose SMS, WhatsApp or email in Settings.": ["Bestellings, geskille, groepbestellings, nakomingsperdatums en veranderinge aan uitvoerreëls. Nuwes kom onmiddellik aan. Kies SMS, WhatsApp of e-pos in Instellings.", "Diodara, dingangišano, diodara tša sehlopha, matšatši a mafelelo a kobamelo le diphetogo tša melao ya go romela ntle. Tše mpsha di fihla gang. Kgetha SMS, WhatsApp goba imeile go Dipeakanyo.", "Tioda, timholovo, tioda ta ntlawa, masiku yo hetelela ya ku landzela milawu na ku cinca ka milawu yo xavisa ehandle. Leswintshwa swi fika hi xihatla. Hlawula SMS, WhatsApp kumbe imeyili eka Swiyimiso.", "Ama-oda, izingxabano, ama-oda eqembu, izinsuku zokugcina zokuthobela nezinguquko zemithetho yokuthekelisa. Ezintsha zifika ngokushesha. Khetha i-SMS, i-WhatsApp noma i-imeyili kuZilungiselelo."],
