  "Pick a product and a market to see the full list of registrations, inspections and documents you need.": ["Kies 'n produk en 'n mark om die volle lys registrasies, inspeksies en dokumente te sien wat jy nodig het.", "Kgetha setšweletšwa le mmaraka go bona lenaneo ka moka la dingwadišo, ditlhahlobo le ditokumente tšeo o di nyakago.", "Hlawula xibuweriwa na makete ku vona nxaxamelo hinkwawo wa ku tsarisa, ku kambela na matsalwa lawa u ma lavaka.", "Khetha umkhiqizo nemakethe ukuze ubone uhlu oluphelele lokubhalisa, ukuhlola nemibhalo oyidingayo."],
  "Pin saved ({lat}, {lng}). Tap the map to move it.": ["Speld gestoor ({lat}, {lng}). Tik op die kaart om dit te skuif.", "Phini e bolokilwe ({lat}, {lng}). Kgotla mmapeng go e šuthiša.", "Phini yi hlayisiwile ({lat}, {lng}). Tsindzela eka mepe ku yi rhurhisa.", "Iphini ilondoloziwe ({lat}, {lng}). Thepha emephini ukuze uyihambise."],
  "Place order": ["Plaas bestelling", "Dira oda", "Endla oda", "Faka i-oda"],
  "Place search is busy right now. Please try again in a moment.": ["Plekke-soektog is tans besig. Probeer asseblief oor 'n oomblik weer.", "Go nyaka mafelo go swaregile bjale. Hle leka gape ka morago ga motsotso.", "Ku lava tindhawu ku khomekile sweswi. Hi kombela u ringeta nakambe endzhaku ka xinkarhana.", "Ukusesha izindawo kumatasa manje. Sicela uzame futhi emva kwesikhashana."],
  "Place {n} order": ["Plaas {n} bestelling", "Dira oda e {n}", "Endla oda ya {n}", "Faka i-oda eli-{n}"],
