  "Plan cancelled.": ["Plan gekanselleer.", "Leano le khanseditšwe.", "Pulani yi khanseriwile.", "Uhlelo lukhanseliwe."],
  "Plant health (phytosanitary) certificates, production unit and packhouse registration, market access.": ["Plantgesondheid (fitosanitêre) sertifikate, registrasie van produksie-eenhede en pakhuise, marktoegang.", "Disetifikeiti tša maphelo a dimela (phytosanitary), ngwadišo ya yuniti ya tšweletšo le ntlo ya go phuthela, phihlelelo ya mmaraka.", "Switifikheti swa rihanyo ra swimila (phytosanitary), ku tsarisa yuniti ya vuhumelerisi na yindlu yo paka, ku fikelela makete.", "Izitifiketi zempilo yezitshalo (phytosanitary), ukubhaliswa kweyunithi yokukhiqiza nendlu yokupakisha, ukufinyelela emakethe."],
  "plant health standards": ["plantgesondheidstandaarde", "maemo a maphelo a dimela", "swiyimo swa rihanyo ra swimila", "amazinga empilo yezitshalo"],
  "Planting month": ["Plantmaand", "Kgwedi ya go bjala", "N'hweti ya ku byala", "Inyanga yokutshala"],
  "PLATFORM": ["PLATFORM", "SETHALA", "XIYIMO", "INKUNDLA"],
  "Please accept the terms and privacy notice.": ["Aanvaar asseblief die voorwaardes en privaatheidskennisgewing.", "Hle amogela melawana le tsebišo ya sephiri.", "Hi kombela u amukela milawu na xitiviso xa xihundla.", "Sicela wamukele imigomo nesaziso sobumfihlo."],
  "Please choose a JPEG, PNG or WebP image.": ["Kies asseblief 'n JPEG-, PNG- of WebP-prent.", "Hle kgetha seswantšho sa JPEG, PNG goba WebP.", "Hi kombela u hlawula xifaniso xa JPEG, PNG kumbe WebP.", "Sicela ukhethe isithombe se-JPEG, PNG noma WebP."],
  "Please tick the consent box first.": ["Merk asseblief eers die toestemmingsblokkie.", "Hle swaya lepokisana la tumelelo pele.", "Hi kombela u funga bokisi ra mpfumelelo ku sungula.", "Sicela umake ibhokisi lemvume kuqala."],
  "Please wait…": ["Wag asseblief…", "Hle ema…", "Hi kombela u yimela…", "Sicela ulinde…"],
  "Polokwane": ["Polokwane", "Polokwane", "Polokwane", "Polokwane"],
  "Pool demand with other farmers and unlock supplier discounts. Joins are counted safely, so an order can never go over its target.": ["Bundel vraag met ander boere en ontsluit verskafferafslag. Aansluitings word veilig getel, sodat 'n bestelling nooit sy teiken kan oorskry nie.", "Kopanya tlhokego le balemi ba bangwe gomme le bule theolelo ya bafepi. Go tsenela go balwa ka polokego, ka gona oda e ka se fete nepo ya yona.", "Hlanganisani xilaveko na varimi van'wana mi pfula swiphiqo swa vaphakeri. Ku nghena ku hlayiwa hi ku hlayiseka, hikwalaho oda a yi nge tluli xikongomelo xa yona.", "Hlanganisani isidingo nabanye abalimi nivule izaphulelo zabahlinzeki. Ukujoyina kubalwa ngokuphepha, ngakho i-oda alisoze ladlula umgomo walo."],
  "POPIA deletion requests": ["POPIA-skrappingsversoeke", "Dikgopelo tša go phumola tša POPIA", "Swikombelo swa ku sula swa POPIA", "Izicelo zokususa ze-POPIA"],
  "POPIA deletion requests from users appear here.": ["POPIA-skrappingsversoeke van gebruikers verskyn hier.", "Dikgopelo tša go phumola tša POPIA go tšwa go badiriši di tšwelela mo.", "Swikombelo swa ku sula swa POPIA ku suka eka vatirhisi swi humelela laha.", "Izicelo zokususa ze-POPIA ezivela kubasebenzisi zivela lapha."],
  "Possible duplicate": ["Moontlike duplikaat", "E ka ba kopi", "Swi nga va kopi", "Kungaba impinda"],
  "potato": ["aartappel", "letsapane", "zambala", "amazambane"],
  "Potatoes": ["Aartappels", "Matsapane", "Tizambala", "Amazambane"],
  "Press \"Add to cart\" on any produce under Browse. You can add produce from several farmers and send all the orders in one go.": ["Druk \"Voeg by mandjie\" op enige produk onder Blaai. Jy kan produkte van verskeie boere byvoeg en al die bestellings in een slag stuur.", "Kgotla \"Tsenya ka kariking\" go dijo dife goba dife ka fase ga Lebelela. O ka oketša dijo go tšwa go balemi ba mmalwa gomme wa romela diodara ka moka ka nako e tee.", "Tsindzela \"Nghenisa eka kariki\" eka xibyariwa xin'wana na xin'wana ehansi ka Languta. U nga engetela swibyariwa ku suka eka varimi vo hlayanyana kutani u rhumela tioda hinkwato hi nkarhi wun'we.", "Cindezela \"Faka enqoleni\" kunoma yimuphi umkhiqizo ngaphansi kokuthi Phequlula. Ungengeza umkhiqizo ovela kubalimi abaningana bese uthumela wonke ama-oda kanyekanye."],
