  "Raise a dispute from the order in Farm Market. The other side has 48 hours to respond, both of you can add evidence, and an administrator makes the final decision.": ["Maak 'n geskil oop vanaf die bestelling in Plaasmark. Die ander kant het 48 uur om te reageer, julle albei kan bewyse byvoeg, en 'n administrateur neem die finale besluit.", "Tšweletša ngangišano go tšwa go oda go Mmaraka wa Polasa. Lehlakore le lengwe le na le diiri tše 48 go araba, ka bobedi le ka oketša bohlatse, gomme molaodi o tšea sephetho sa mafelelo.", "Tlakusa mholovo ku suka eka oda eka Makete wa Purasi. Lehlakore lin'wana li na tiawara ta 48 ku hlamula, hamambirhi mi nga engetela vumbhoni, kutani mulawuri u teka xiboho xo hetelela.", "Vula ingxabano kusuka ku-oda eMakethe yePulazi. Olunye uhlangothi lunamahora angama-48 okuphendula, nobabili ningengeza ubufakazi, futhi umphathi uthatha isinqumo sokugcina."],
