  "Reason (optional). Press Cancel to keep the order.": ["Rede (opsioneel). Druk Kanselleer om die bestelling te behou.", "Lebaka (ga go gapeletšwe). Kgotla Khansela go boloka oda.", "Xivangelo (a swi bohi). Tsindzela Khansela ku hlayisa oda.", "Isizathu (akuphoqelekile). Cindezela Khansela ukuze ugcine i-oda."],
  "RECOMMENDED FOR YOUR FARM": ["AANBEVEEL VIR JOU PLAAS", "E ŠIŠINYWA BAKENG SA POLASA YA GAGO", "SWI TSUNDZUXIWA EKA PURASI RA WENA", "KUNCONYWA EPULAZINI LAKHO"],
  "Record a sale or expense, or upload a bank statement, to see your cash flow.": ["Teken 'n verkoping of uitgawe aan, of laai 'n bankstaat op, om jou kontantvloei te sien.", "Ngwala thekišo goba tshenyegelo, goba romela setatemente sa panka, go bona phallo ya tšhelete ya gago.", "Tsala xixavisiwa kumbe xihlawulo, kumbe u rhumela xitatimende xa banka, ku vona ku khuluka ka mali ya wena.", "Bhala ukuthengisa noma izindleko, noma ulayishe isitatimende sasebhange, ukuze ubone ukugeleza kwemali yakho."],
