  "Recorded activity to review": ["Aangetekende aktiwiteit om te hersien", "Ditiro tše di ngwadilwego tše di swanetšego go lekolwa", "Mintirho leyi tsariweke leyi faneleke ku kambeliwa", "Umsebenzi obhaliwe okufanele ubuyekezwe"],
  "Recorded items in common: {items}": ["Aangetekende items in gemeen: {items}", "Dilo tše di ngwadilwego tše di swanago: {items}", "Swilo leswi tsariweke leswi fanaka: {items}", "Izinto ezibhaliwe ezifanayo: {items}"],
  "Reference number, contact person, date applied": ["Verwysingsnommer, kontakpersoon, datum aansoek gedoen", "Nomoro ya tšhupetšo, motho wa kgokagano, letšatšikgwedi la kgopelo", "Nomboro ya nkombo, munhu wa vuhlanganisi, siku ro kombela", "Inombolo yesithenjwa, umuntu oxhumana naye, usuku lokufaka isicelo"],
  "Refresh comparisons": ["Verfris vergelykings", "Mpshafatša dipapetšo", "Pfuxeta ku pimanisa", "Vuselela ukuqhathanisa"],
  "Registered with CIPC; limits my personal liability.": ["By CIPC geregistreer; beperk my persoonlike aanspreeklikheid.", "E ngwadišitšwe go CIPC; e fokotša maikarabelo a ka a motho.", "Yi tsarisiwile eka CIPC; yi hunguta vutihlamuleri bya mina bya munhu.", "Libhaliswe ku-CIPC; linciphisa isikweletu sami somuntu siqu."],
  "Registration number": ["Registrasienommer", "Nomoro ya ngwadišo", "Nomboro ya ku tsarisa", "Inombolo yokubhalisa"],
  "registration {n}": ["registrasie {n}", "ngwadišo {n}", "ku tsarisa {n}", "ukubhalisa {n}"],
  "regulatory changes waiting for review": ["regulatoriese veranderinge wat op hersiening wag", "diphetogo tša taolo tše di letetšego tekolo", "ku cinca ka milawu loku rindzeleke nkambelo", "izinguquko zemithetho ezilinde ukubuyekezwa"],
  "Regulatory content is seeded as DRAFT. It must be checked by someone qualified (agricultural economist, export agent, tax practitioner) against the official source and marked verified. Farmers see the review status next to each item.": ["Regulatoriese inhoud word as KONSEP gelaai. Dit moet deur iemand gekwalifiseerd (landbou-ekonoom, uitvoeragent, belastingpraktisyn) teen die amptelike bron nagegaan en as geverifieer gemerk word. Boere sien die hersieningstatus langs elke item.", "Diteng tša taolo di tsentšwe bjalo ka KAKANYO. Di swanetše go lekolwa ke motho yo a rutegilego (setsebi sa ekonomi ya temo, moemedi wa go romela ntle, setsebi sa motšhelo) go ya ka mothopo wa semmušo gomme di swaiwe bjalo ka tše di netefaditšwego. Balemi ba bona boemo bja tekolo kgauswi le selo se sengwe le se sengwe.", "Leswi nga endzeni swa milawu swi nghenisiwile tanihi XIRINGANYETO. Swi fanele ku kambeliwa hi munhu loyi a dyondzeke (xitsundzuxi xa ikhonomi ya vurimi, muyimeri wa ku xavisa ehandle, xitsundzuxi xa xibalo) hi ku ya hi xihlovo xa ximfumo kutani swi fungiwa tanihi leswi tiyisisiweke. Varimi va vona xiyimo xa nkambelo etlhelo ka nchumu wun'wana na wun'wana.", "Okuqukethwe kwemithetho kufakwe NJENGOKUSALUNGISWA. Kufanele kuhlolwe ngumuntu oqeqeshiwe (isazi sezomnotho wezolimo, umenzeli wokuthekelisa, umeluleki wentela) ngokuqhathanisa nomthombo osemthethweni futhi kumakwe njengokuqinisekisiwe. Abalimi babona isimo sokubuyekezwa eceleni kwento ngayinye."],
  "Reminders go out 30, 7 and 1 days before each date, by the channels you chose in Settings. Dates marked \"estimate\" follow the usual cycle; confirm them with the authority.": ["Herinneringe gaan 30, 7 en 1 dag voor elke datum uit, via die kanale wat jy in Instellings gekies het. Datums gemerk \"skatting\" volg die gewone siklus; bevestig dit by die owerheid.", "Dikgopotšo di romelwa matšatši a 30, 7 le 1 pele ga letšatšikgwedi le lengwe le le lengwe, ka ditsela tšeo o di kgethilego go Dipeakanyo. Matšatši a a swailwego \"kakanyo\" a latela mokgwa wa ka mehla; a netefatše go bolaodi.", "Switsundzuxo swi rhumeriwa masiku ya 30, 7 na 1 ku nga si fika siku rin'wana na rin'wana, hi tindlela leti u ti hlawuleke eka Swiyimiso. Masiku lama fungiweke \"xiringanyeto\" ma landzela ndlela ya ntolovelo; ma tiyisise eka vulawuri.", "Izikhumbuzo zithunyelwa izinsuku ezingama-30, 7 no-1 ngaphambi kosuku ngalunye, ngezindlela ozikhethe kuZilungiselelo. Izinsuku ezimakwe \"isilinganiso\" zilandela umjikelezo ojwayelekile; ziqinisekise esiphathimandleni."],
