  "Segments are rule-based until enough marketplace data exists to train the ML model (see Market Insights).": ["Segmente is reëlgebaseer totdat daar genoeg markdata is om die ML-model op te lei (sien Markinsigte).", "Dihlopha di theilwe melaong go fihlela go na le data ye e lekanego ya mmaraka go tlwaetša mmotlolo wa ML (bona Tsebo ya Mmaraka).", "Mintlawa yi sekeriwile eka milawu ku fikela ku va na data leyi eneleke ya makete ku dyondzisa modlolo wa ML (vona Vutivi bya Makete).", "Izigaba zisekelwe emithethweni kuze kube nedatha eyanele yemakethe yokuqeqesha imodeli ye-ML (bheka Ulwazi Lwemakethe)."],
