  "Sell directly to buyers, formalise and plan your business, understand every rand you spend, and get export-ready, with guidance tagged to the authority that requires it.": ["Verkoop direk aan kopers, formaliseer en beplan jou besigheid, verstaan elke rand wat jy spandeer, en word uitvoergereed, met riglyne gekoppel aan die owerheid wat dit vereis.", "Rekiša thwii go bareki, dira kgwebo ya gago ya semmušo o e rulaganye, kwešiša randa ye nngwe le ye nngwe ye o e šomišago, gomme o itokišetše go romela ntle, ka tlhahlo ye e golagantšwego le bolaodi bjo bo e nyakago.", "Xavisa hi ku kongoma eka vaxavi, endla bindzu ra wena ri va ra ximfumo u ri pulana, twisisa randa yin'wana na yin'wana leyi u yi tirhisaka, kutani u tilulamisela ku xavisa ehandle, hi nkongomiso lowu hlanganisiweke na vulawuri lebyi wu lavaka.", "Thengisa ngqo kubathengi, yenza ibhizinisi lakho libe semthethweni futhi ulihlele, uqonde irandi ngalinye olisebenzisayo, futhi ulungele ukuthekelisa, ngomhlahlandlela oxhunywe nesiphathimandla esiwudingayo."],
  "Sell inputs to farmer groups": ["Verkoop insette aan boeregroepe", "Rekiša ditlabakelo go dihlopha tša balemi", "Xavisa swipfuno swa vurimi eka mintlawa ya varimi", "Thengisa izinto zokulima emaqenjini abalimi"],
