  "Something in that form is not right. Please check it and try again.": ["Iets in daardie vorm is nie reg nie. Gaan dit asseblief na en probeer weer.", "Go na le selo se se sa lokago foromong yeo. Hle e lekole o leke gape.", "Ku na nchumu lowu nga lulamangiki eka fomo yoleyo. Hi kombela u yi kambela u ringeta nakambe.", "Kukhona okungalungile kulelo fomu. Sicela ulihlole bese uzama futhi."],
  "Something went wrong": ["Iets het skeefgeloop", "Go na le seo se sa sepelago gabotse", "Ku ve ni leswi nga fambangiki kahle", "Kukhona okungahambanga kahle"],
  "Something went wrong on our side. Please try again in a moment.": ["Iets het aan ons kant skeefgeloop. Probeer asseblief oor 'n oomblik weer.", "Go na le seo se sa sepelago gabotse ka lehlakoreng la rena. Hle leka gape ka morago ga motsotso.", "Ku ve ni leswi nga fambangiki kahle hi tlhelo ra hina. Hi kombela u ringeta nakambe endzhaku ka xinkarhana.", "Kukhona okungahambanga kahle ohlangothini lwethu. Sicela uzame futhi emva kwesikhashana."],
  "Something went wrong. Please try again.": ["Iets het skeefgeloop. Probeer asseblief weer.", "Go na le seo se sa sepelago gabotse. Hle leka gape.", "Ku ve ni leswi nga fambangiki kahle. Hi kombela u ringeta nakambe.", "Kukhona okungahambanga kahle. Sicela uzame futhi."],
