  "Start one for something you buy often, such as fertiliser or seed, and invite farmers nearby.": ["Begin een vir iets wat jy dikwels koop, soos kunsmis of saad, en nooi boere naby.", "Thoma ye nngwe bakeng sa selo se o se rekago gantši, go swana le monontšha goba dipeu, o laletše balemi ba kgauswi.", "Sungula yin'we ya nchumu lowu u wu xavaka nkarhi na nkarhi, ku fana na manyoro kumbe timbewu, u rhamba varimi va le kusuhi.", "Qala elilodwa lento oyithenga njalo, njengomanyolo noma imbewu, bese umema abalimi abaseduze."],
  "Start one to unlock a bulk discount with other farmers.": ["Begin een om 'n grootmaatafslag saam met ander boere te ontsluit.", "Thoma ye nngwe go bula theolelo ya bontši le balemi ba bangwe.", "Sungula yin'we ku pfula xiphiqo xa xitalo na varimi van'wana.", "Qala elilodwa ukuze uvule isaphulelo sobuningi nabanye abalimi."],
  "Start plan with {n} requirements": ["Begin plan met {n} vereistes", "Thoma leano ka dinyakego tše {n}", "Sungula pulani hi swilaveko swa {n}", "Qala uhlelo ngezidingo ezingu-{n}"],
  "Start with your ID and, if you have one, your CIPC registration certificate. Lenders and export agents ask for these first.": ["Begin met jou ID en, as jy een het, jou CIPC-registrasiesertifikaat. Uitleners en uitvoeragente vra eerste hiervoor.", "Thoma ka ID ya gago gomme, ge o na le sona, setifikeiti sa gago sa ngwadišo sa CIPC. Baadimi le baemedi ba go romela ntle ba kgopela tše pele.", "Sungula hi ID ya wena naswona, loko u ri na xona, xitifikheti xa wena xa ku tsarisa xa CIPC. Vahlayisi va swikweleti na vayimeri vo xavisa ehandle va kombela leswi ku sungula.", "Qala nge-ID yakho futhi, uma unaso, isitifiketi sakho sokubhalisa se-CIPC. Ababoleki nabenzeli bokuthekelisa bacela lokhu kuqala."],
