  "Status": ["Status", "Boemo", "Xiyimo", "Isimo"],
  "Step completed.": ["Stap voltooi.", "Kgato e phethilwe.", "Goza ri herile.", "Isinyathelo siqediwe."],
  "Step saved. It is marked as draft until verified.": ["Stap gestoor. Dit word as konsep gemerk totdat dit geverifieer is.", "Kgato e bolokilwe. E swailwe bjalo ka kakanyo go fihlela e netefatšwa.", "Goza ri hlayisiwile. Ri fungiwile tanihi xiringanyeto ku fikela ri tiyisisiwa.", "Isinyathelo silondoloziwe. Simakwe njengokusalungiswa kuze kuqinisekiswe."],
  "Stop filtering by distance": ["Hou op om volgens afstand te filtreer", "Emiša go sefa go ya ka sebaka", "Yimisa ku hluta hi mpfhuka", "Yeka ukuhlunga ngebanga"],
