  "This requirement was updated after you started": ["Hierdie vereiste is bygewerk nadat jy begin het", "Nyakego ye e mpshafaditšwe ka morago ga ge o thomile", "Xilaveko lexi xi pfuxetiwile endzhaku ka loko u sungurile", "Lesi sidingo sibuyekeziwe ngemva kokuthi uqalile"],
