  "Tip: add crops to your business plan (Business Builder) to tag costs per crop.": ["Wenk: voeg gewasse by jou sakeplan (Besigheidsbouer) om koste per gewas te merk.", "Keletšo: oketša dibjalo leanong la gago la kgwebo (Mohlami wa Kgwebo) go swaya ditshenyegelo ka sebjalo.", "Xitsundzuxo: engetela swimila eka pulani ya wena ya bindzu (Muakhi wa Bindzu) ku funga swihlawulo hi ximila.", "Ithiphu: engeza izitshalo ohlelweni lwakho lwebhizinisi (uMakhi weBhizinisi) ukuze umake izindleko ngesitshalo."],
