  "Too many tries. Please wait a moment and try again.": ["Te veel pogings. Wag asseblief 'n oomblik en probeer weer.", "Maiteko a mantši kudu. Hle ema motsotso o leke gape.", "Ku ringeta ko tala ngopfu. Hi kombela u yimela xinkarhana u ringeta nakambe.", "Imizamo eminingi kakhulu. Sicela ulinde isikhashana bese uzama futhi."],
