  "Trading in my own name, registered with SARS.": ["Handel in my eie naam, by SARS geregistreer.", "Ke gweba ka leina la ka, ke ngwadišitšwe go SARS.", "Ndzi xavisa hi vito ra mina, ndzi tsarisiwile eka SARS.", "Ngihweba egameni lami, ngibhaliswe ku-SARS."],
  "Transactions": ["Transaksies", "Ditirišano", "Swiendlakalo", "Okwenziwe"],
  "Transfers and personal excluded": ["Oordragte en persoonlike uitgesluit", "Diphetišetšo le tša motho ga di balwe", "Ku hundzisela na swa munhu a swi hlayiwi", "Ukudluliswa nokomuntu siqu akubalwa"],
  "Try a wider search or remove the distance filter.": ["Probeer 'n wyer soektog of verwyder die afstandfilter.", "Leka nyakišišo ye pharephare goba o tloše sefa sa sebaka.", "Ringeta ku lava ka le ndzhenini kumbe u susa xihluti xa mpfhuka.", "Zama ukusesha okubanzi noma ususe isihlungi sebanga."],
  "Try a wider search, remove the distance filter, or list your own produce under My listings.": ["Probeer 'n wyer soektog, verwyder die afstandfilter, of lys jou eie produkte onder My lyste.", "Leka nyakišišo ye pharephare, tloša sefa sa sebaka, goba o ngwale dijo tša gago ka fase ga Dipapatšo tša ka.", "Ringeta ku lava ka le ndzhenini, susa xihluti xa mpfhuka, kumbe u tsala swibyariwa swa wena ehansi ka Swinavetiso swa mina.", "Zama ukusesha okubanzi, susa isihlungi sebanga, noma ufake umkhiqizo wakho ngaphansi kokuthi Okufakiwe kwami."],
  "Try another filter.": ["Probeer 'n ander filter.", "Leka sefa se sengwe.", "Ringeta xihluti xin'wana.", "Zama esinye isihlungi."],
  "Turn off two-step sign-in": ["Skakel tweestap-aanmelding af", "Tima go tsena ka magato a mabedi", "Tima ku nghena hi magoza mambirhi", "Vala ukungena ngezinyathelo ezimbili"],
  "Turn on": ["Skakel aan", "Bula", "Pfula", "Vula"],
  "Two-step sign-in": ["Tweestap-aanmelding", "Go tsena ka magato a mabedi", "Ku nghena hi magoza mambirhi", "Ukungena ngezinyathelo ezimbili"],
  "Two-step sign-in is off.": ["Tweestap-aanmelding is af.", "Go tsena ka magato a mabedi go timilwe.", "Ku nghena hi magoza mambirhi ku timiwile.", "Ukungena ngezinyathelo ezimbili kuvaliwe."],
  "Two-step sign-in is on.": ["Tweestap-aanmelding is aan.", "Go tsena ka magato a mabedi go butšwe.", "Ku nghena hi magoza mambirhi ku pfuriwile.", "Ukungena ngezinyathelo ezimbili kuvuliwe."],
  "Type": ["Tipe", "Mohuta", "Muxaka", "Uhlobo"],
  "Type a message…": ["Tik 'n boodskap…", "Ngwala molaetša…", "Tsala rungula…", "Bhala umlayezo…"],
  "Type a town or area first, then press Find on map.": ["Tik eers 'n dorp of gebied en druk dan Vind op kaart.", "Ngwala toropo goba lefelo pele, ke moka o kgotle Hwetša mmapeng.", "Tsala doroba kumbe ndhawu ku sungula, kutani u tsindzela Kuma eka mepe.", "Bhala idolobha noma indawo kuqala, bese ucindezela Thola emephini."],
  "Type the 6-digit code the app shows:": ["Tik die 6-syferkode wat die app wys:", "Ngwala khoutu ya dinomoro tše 6 yeo app e e bontšhago:", "Tsala khodi ya tinomboro ta 6 leyi app yi yi kombisaka:", "Bhala ikhodi yezinombolo eziyi-6 ekhonjiswa yi-app:"],
  "Unable to load your overview.": ["Kon nie jou oorsig laai nie.", "Ga re a kgona go laiša kakaretšo ya gago.", "A hi swi kotanga ku layicha nkatsakanyo wa wena.", "Asikwazanga ukulayisha ukubuka konke kwakho."],
  "Under R50 000 a year": ["Minder as R50 000 per jaar", "Ka fase ga R50 000 ka ngwaga", "Ehansi ka R50 000 hi lembe", "Ngaphansi kuka-R50 000 ngonyaka"],
