  "Upload a bank statement. We read it, check that the balances add up, sort every transaction into a farm category and show your cost per crop, trends and anything unusual.": ["Laai 'n bankstaat op. Ons lees dit, kontroleer dat die balanse klop, sorteer elke transaksie in 'n plaaskategorie en wys jou koste per gewas, tendense en enigiets ongewoons.", "Romela setatemente sa panka. Re a se bala, re lekola gore ditekano di lekalekana, re hlopha tirišano ye nngwe le ye nngwe ka legorong la polasa gomme re bontšha tshenyegelo ka sebjalo, mekgwa le se sengwe le se sengwe se se sa tlwaelegago.", "Rhumela xitatimende xa banka. Hi xi hlaya, hi kambela leswaku tibalansi ti ringana, hi hlela xiendlakalo xin'wana na xin'wana eka ntlawa wa purasi kutani hi ku komba xihlawulo hi ximila, mikhuva na swin'wana leswi nga tolovelekangiki.", "Layisha isitatimende sasebhange. Siyasifunda, sihlole ukuthi amabhalansi ayahambisana, sihlele okwenziwe ngakunye esigabeni sepulazi futhi sikukhombise izindleko ngesitshalo, amathrendi nanoma yini engajwayelekile."],
  "Upload a statement and confirm it. Your monthly summary, cost per crop and unusual-expense flags appear here.": ["Laai 'n staat op en bevestig dit. Jou maandelikse opsomming, koste per gewas en ongewone-uitgawe-merkers verskyn hier.", "Romela setatemente o se netefatše. Kakaretšo ya gago ya kgwedi, tshenyegelo ka sebjalo le maswao a ditshenyegelo tše di sa tlwaelegago di tšwelela mo.", "Rhumela xitatimende u xi tiyisisa. Nkatsakanyo wa wena wa n'hweti, xihlawulo hi ximila na swikombiso swa swihlawulo leswi nga tolovelekangiki swi humelela laha.", "Layisha isitatimende bese usiqinisekisa. Isifinyezo sakho sanyanga zonke, izindleko ngesitshalo namafulegi ezindleko ezingajwayelekile kuvela lapha."],
