  "Use at least 8 characters with a letter and a number.": ["Gebruik ten minste 8 karakters met 'n letter en 'n syfer.", "Šomiša bonyane ditlhaka tše 8 ka tlhaka le nomoro.", "Tirhisa kwalomu ka maletere ya 8 na letere na nomboro.", "Sebenzisa okungenani izinhlamvu ezi-8 nohlamvu nenombolo."],
