  "You agreed on {date} that we may read your statements. You can withdraw this in Settings.": ["Jy het op {date} ingestem dat ons jou state mag lees. Jy kan dit in Instellings terugtrek.", "O dumetše ka {date} gore re ka bala ditatemente tša gago. O ka e boetša morago go Dipeakanyo.", "U pfumerile hi {date} leswaku hi nga hlaya swiviko swa wena. U nga swi tlherisela endzhaku eka Swiyimiso.", "Uvumile ngo-{date} ukuthi singafunda izitatimende zakho. Ungakuhoxisa lokhu kuZilungiselelo."],
