  "You are in the": ["Jy is in die", "O ka sehlopheng sa", "U eka ntlawa wa", "Usesigabeni"],
  "You are not allowed to do that.": ["Jy mag dit nie doen nie.", "Ga o dumelelwe go dira seo.", "A wu pfumeleriwi ku endla sweswo.", "Awuvunyelwe ukwenza lokho."],
  "You are offline. Showing the pages you opened before; changes will need signal.": ["Jy is vanlyn. Wys die bladsye wat jy voorheen oopgemaak het; veranderinge sal sein nodig hê.", "Ga o inthaneteng. Go bontšhwa matlakala ao o kilego wa a bula; diphetogo di tla nyaka mogala.", "A wu le ka inthanete. Ku kombisiwa tipheji leti u ti pfuleke khale; ku cinca ku ta lava siginali.", "Awuxhunyiwe. Kukhonjiswa amakhasi owavule ngaphambili; izinguquko zizodinga isiginali."],
  "You are offline. This will work again when you have signal.": ["Jy is vanlyn. Dit sal weer werk wanneer jy sein het.", "Ga o inthaneteng. Se se tla šoma gape ge o na le mogala.", "A wu le ka inthanete. Leswi swi ta tirha nakambe loko u ri na siginali.", "Awuxhunyiwe. Lokhu kuzosebenza futhi uma unesiginali."],
  "You can rate a supplier once you have joined one of their group orders. Rating again replaces your earlier rating.": ["Jy kan 'n verskaffer gradeer sodra jy by een van hul groepbestellings aangesluit het. Weer gradeer vervang jou vorige gradering.", "O ka lekanyetša mofepi ge o šetše o tsenetše e nngwe ya diodara tša gagwe tša sehlopha. Go lekanyetša gape go tšea legato la tekanyetšo ya gago ya pele.", "U nga pima muphakeri loko u nghenile eka yin'wana ya tioda ta yena ta ntlawa. Ku pima nakambe ku siva mpimo wa wena wo sungula.", "Ungalinganisa umhlinzeki uma usujoyine elinye lama-oda akhe eqembu. Ukulinganisa futhi kuthatha indawo yesilinganiso sakho sangaphambili."],
  "You decide how your information is used. Every change is recorded with the date and the version of the notice.": ["Jy besluit hoe jou inligting gebruik word. Elke verandering word aangeteken met die datum en die weergawe van die kennisgewing.", "Ke wena yo a tšeago sephetho ka moo tshedimošo ya gago e šomišwago ka gona. Phetogo ye nngwe le ye nngwe e ngwalwa le letšatšikgwedi le kgatišo ya tsebišo.", "Hi wena loyi a bohaka ndlela leyi vuxokoxoko bya wena byi tirhisiwaka ha yona. Ku cinca kun'wana na kun'wana ku tsariwa na siku na vuhundzuluxi bya xitiviso.", "Nguwe onquma ukuthi ulwazi lwakho lusetshenziswa kanjani. Uguquko ngalunye lubhalwa nosuku nenguqulo yesaziso."],
  "You filled the order! The target is reached and everyone has been told.": ["Jy het die bestelling vol gemaak! Die teiken is bereik en almal is ingelig.", "O tladitše oda! Nepo e fihleletšwe gomme bohle ba tsebišitšwe.", "U tatile oda! Xikongomelo xi fikeleriwile naswona hinkwavo va tivisiwile.", "Ugcwalise i-oda! Umgomo ufinyelelwe futhi wonke umuntu waziswe."],
  "You have no listings yet": ["Jy het nog geen lyste nie", "Ga o na dipapatšo gabjale", "A wu si va na swinavetiso", "Awukabi nakho okufakiwe"],
  "You have not ordered anything": ["Jy het niks bestel nie", "Ga se wa oda selo", "A wu si oda nchumu", "Awukaze u-ode lutho"],
  "You joined the group order.": ["Jy het by die groepbestelling aangesluit.", "O tsenetše oda ya sehlopha.", "U nghenile eka oda ya ntlawa.", "Ujoyine i-oda leqembu."],
  "You pay each farmer in cash on delivery. Each farmer gets their own order and must accept it, so they may reply at different times.": ["Jy betaal elke boer kontant by aflewering. Elke boer kry sy eie bestelling en moet dit aanvaar, so hulle kan op verskillende tye antwoord.", "O lefa molemi yo mongwe le yo mongwe ka kheše ge di fihla. Molemi yo mongwe le yo mongwe o hwetša oda ya gagwe gomme o swanetše go e amogela, ka gona ba ka araba ka dinako tše di fapanego.", "U hakela murimi un'wana na un'wana hi khexe loko swi fika. Murimi un'wana na un'wana u kuma oda ya yena naswona u fanele ku yi amukela, hikwalaho va nga hlamula hi minkarhi yo hambana.", "Ukhokha umlimi ngamunye ngokheshi uma kulethwa. Umlimi ngamunye uthola i-oda lakhe futhi kufanele alamukele, ngakho bangaphendula ngezikhathi ezahlukene."],
  "You pay the farmer in cash when the produce is delivered.": ["Jy betaal die boer kontant wanneer die produkte afgelewer word.", "O lefa molemi ka kheše ge dijo di fihla.", "U hakela murimi hi khexe loko swibyariwa swi fika.", "Ukhokha umlimi ngokheshi uma umkhiqizo ulethwa."],
  "You raised the dispute": ["Jy het die geskil aanhangig gemaak", "O tšweleditše ngangišano", "U tlakusile mholovo", "Uvule ingxabano"],
  "You rated this order. Thank you.": ["Jy het hierdie bestelling gegradeer. Dankie.", "O lekantšhitše oda ye. Re a leboga.", "U pimile oda leyi. Hi khensa.", "Ulinganise leli oda. Siyabonga."],
  "You responded": ["Jy het geantwoord", "O arabile", "U hlamurile", "Uphendulile"],
  "You started this": ["Jy het dit begin", "O thomile se", "U sungurile leswi", "Nguwe oqale lokhu"],
  "You:": ["Jy:", "Wena:", "Wena:", "Wena:"],
  "Your account.": ["Jou rekening.", "Akhaonte ya gago.", "Akhawunti ya wena.", "I-akhawunti yakho."],
  "Your actual: {price}": ["Jou werklike: {price}", "Ya gago ya nnete: {price}", "Ya wena ya xiviri: {price}", "Okwakho kwangempela: {price}"],
  "Your browser cannot share your location. Type a town instead.": ["Jou blaaier kan nie jou ligging deel nie. Tik eerder 'n dorp.", "Sebadi sa gago ga se kgone go abelana lefelo la gago. Ngwala toropo.", "Browser ya wena a yi koti ku avelana ndhawu ya wena. Tsala doroba.", "Isiphequluli sakho asikwazi ukwabelana ngendawo yakho. Bhala idolobha esikhundleni salokho."],
  "Your business": ["Jou besigheid", "Kgwebo ya gago", "Bindzu ra wena", "Ibhizinisi lakho"],
  "Your cart is empty": ["Jou mandjie is leeg", "Kariki ya gago ga e na selo", "Kariki ya wena a yi na nchumu", "Inqola yakho ayinalutho"],
  "Your comparison may be less reliable with so few expense records.": ["Jou vergelyking is dalk minder betroubaar met so min uitgawerekords.", "Papetšo ya gago e ka no se tshepagale kudu ka direkhoto tše mmalwa bjalo tša ditshenyegelo.", "Ku pimanisa ka wena ku nga ha va ku nga tshembeki ngopfu hi tirekhodo tingani ta swihlawulo.", "Ukuqhathanisa kwakho kungase kungathembeki kangako ngamarekhodi ambalwa kangaka ezindleko."],
  "Your cost per unit (private)": ["Jou koste per eenheid (privaat)", "Tshenyegelo ya gago ka yuniti (sephiri)", "Xihlawulo xa wena hi yuniti (xihundla)", "Izindleko zakho ngeyunithi (ziyimfihlo)"],
  "Your delivery code:": ["Jou afleweringskode:", "Khoutu ya gago ya go iša:", "Khodi ya wena ya ku yisa:", "Ikhodi yakho yokulethwa:"],
