  "Your farm business is fully set up": ["Jou plaasbesigheid is ten volle opgestel", "Kgwebo ya gago ya polasa e beakantšwe ka botlalo", "Bindzu ra wena ra purasi ri lulamisiwile hi ku helela", "Ibhizinisi lakho lepulazi lihlelwe ngokuphelele"],
  "Your farm comparisons": ["Jou plaasvergelykings", "Dipapetšo tša polasa ya gago", "Ku pimanisa ka purasi ra wena", "Ukuqhathanisa kwepulazi lakho"],
  "YOUR FARM TODAY": ["JOU PLAAS VANDAG", "POLASA YA GAGO LEHONO", "PURASI RA WENA NAMUNTLHA", "IPULAZI LAKHO NAMUHLA"],
  "Your first statement takes about a minute. Try last month's CSV export from your bank's app.": ["Jou eerste staat neem sowat 'n minuut. Probeer verlede maand se CSV-uitvoer uit jou bank se app.", "Setatemente sa gago sa mathomo se tšea motsotso o ka bago o tee. Leka CSV ya kgwedi ye e fetilego go tšwa go app ya panka ya gago.", "Xitatimende xa wena xo sungula xi teka kwalomu ka minete. Ringeta CSV ya n'hweti leyi hundzeke ku suka eka app ya banka ya wena.", "Isitatimende sakho sokuqala sithatha cishe umzuzu. Zama i-CSV yenyanga edlule evela ku-app yebhange lakho."],
  "Your ID, CIPC certificate, tax clearance, permits, GLOBALG.A.P. and PUC certificates and statements. Encrypted, with expiry reminders, and ready to attach to your export plan or loan application.": ["Jou ID, CIPC-sertifikaat, belastingklaring, permitte, GLOBALG.A.P.- en PUC-sertifikate en state. Geënkripteer, met vervalherinneringe, en gereed om by jou uitvoerplan of leningsaansoek aan te heg.", "ID ya gago, setifikeiti sa CIPC, tumelelo ya motšhelo, diphemiti, disetifikeiti tša GLOBALG.A.P. le PUC le ditatemente. Di notletšwe, di na le dikgopotšo tša go fela nako, gomme di loketše go kgomaretšwa leanong la gago la go romela ntle goba kgopelong ya kadimo.", "ID ya wena, xitifikheti xa CIPC, mpfumelelo wa xibalo, tiphemiti, switifikheti swa GLOBALG.A.P. na PUC na swiviko. Swi khiyiwile, swi na switsundzuxo swa ku hela nkarhi, naswona swi lulamele ku namarhetiwa eka pulani ya wena yo xavisa ehandle kumbe xikombelo xa xikweleti.", "I-ID yakho, isitifiketi se-CIPC, imvume yentela, izimvume, izitifiketi ze-GLOBALG.A.P. ne-PUC nezitatimende. Kubethelwe, kunezikhumbuzo zokuphelelwa yisikhathi, futhi kulungele ukunamathiselwa ohlelweni lwakho lokuthekelisa noma esicelweni semalimboleko."],
  "Your information": ["Jou inligting", "Tshedimošo ya gago", "Vuxokoxoko bya wena", "Ulwazi lwakho"],
