  "Your personal checklist and compliance calendar are ready.": ["Jou persoonlike kontrolelys en nakomingskalender is gereed.", "Lenaneo la gago la tlhahlobo le khalendara ya kobamelo di loketše.", "Nxaxamelo wa wena wo kambela na khalendara ya ku landzela milawu swi lulamile.", "Uhlu lwakho lokuhlola nekhalenda yokuthobela sekulungile."],
  "Your photo and what you produce. Change your name, language, alerts, password and privacy choices in Settings.": ["Jou foto en wat jy produseer. Verander jou naam, taal, waarskuwings, wagwoord en privaatheidskeuses in Instellings.", "Seswantšho sa gago le seo o se tšweletšago. Fetola leina, polelo, ditemošo, lentšuphetišo le dikgetho tša sephiri go Dipeakanyo.", "Xifaniso xa wena na leswi u swi humelerisaka. Cinca vito, ririmi, switsundzuxo, phasiwedi na swihlawulo swa xihundla eka Swiyimiso.", "Isithombe sakho nalokho okukhiqizayo. Shintsha igama, ulimi, izexwayiso, iphasiwedi nokukhetha kobumfihlo kuZilungiselelo."],
